+- [x] 1.2 Add `OrderRepository.applyCoupon(id, couponCode, discountCents, finalAmountCents)` and `OrderRepository.recordRedemption(orderId, couponCode, discountCents, createdAt)`; verify with a focused test that both rows are written
+- [x] 1.3 Add `CouponRepository.incrementUsedCount(code)`; verify with a focused test that `usedCount` goes from 0 to 1
+- [x] 1.4 Wire `CouponRepository` and `Db` into `OrderService` in `src/app.ts`; verify `npm run build` passes
